{
  "case_id": "MIGRATION-SMOKE-26.1.2",
  "title": "26.1.2 迁移冒烟：探针基础设施 / 124 物品注册 / 附件可读 / Curios 槽位与骰子装配 / dump 机器行 / OP 判据同源",
  "version": "26.1.2",
  "target": {
    "type": "existing-feature",
    "ref": "mc-26.1.2-migration"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "第一轮(2026-09-16)通过；2026-09-17 第二轮前已把 run 侧探针换成**完整迁移版**(astral_bugfix_probe.js,1.21.1 → 26.1.2),本条目的 M1 断言随之改为锚定完整探针 doDiag 的关键读数(levelClass / scheduler / dmgMessage),M2~M6 仍用迁移期附加命令(itemcount/give/equipslot/readstate)与原有 dumpstate。\n【2026-09-19 计数刷新(本次只改本文件)】`AP_M2_ITEMCOUNT` 的期望由 **123 → 124**,title 里的计数同步。来源:本会话把「游戏大师立牌(ren)」迁进 26.1.2,新增物品 `ren_sign`(`neoforge-26.1.2/src/main/java/com/merlinkitsune/astral_dice/item/ModItems.java:882` 的 `registerItem(ren_sign, …)` 与 `datagen/ModItemModelProvider.java:112` 的 `basicItem(itemModels, ModItems.REN_SIGN.get())`),`src/generated/clientResources/assets/astral_dice/items/` 的物品定义 123 → **124**;本轮实测 `temp/t72/case-MIGRATION-SMOKE-26.1.2.log` 读数全文 = `AP_M2_ITEMCOUNT:astral_dice=124:total=1631`。⇒ **124 = 原 123 + ren_sign**;下次再新增物品请照此把新值写成「旧值 + 新增物品」,不要再产生无来源的魔法数字。同文件 absent 断言里的 `astral_dice=(0|-1)` 是「空注册表 / 读失败」形态,**不是计数**,无需同步。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe diag M1"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe itemcount M2"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe give \"astral_dice:dice\" 1 M3"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe equipslot dice \"astral_dice:dice\" M4"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe readstate M5"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe dumpstate M6"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_M1_DIAG:levelClass=net\\.minecraft\\.server\\.level\\.ServerLevel"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
